  "name": "Catch'em copy rules",
  "version": 2,
  "about": "The one shared copy checker. Catchem-data builds, catchem-site and catchem-bot all read this file. The site keeps a byte-for-byte copy of this file and of scripts/lib/advice-intent.mjs, the bot keeps a copy of this file and a Python port, and tests fail when a copy drifts from Catchem-data main. rules/advice-cases.json is the labelled test set every copy must pass at 100%. A flag names the line, the rule, the matched span and the reason. Nothing is rewritten.",
